{"id":"u-b86d6ce3-8ab4-42ab-8ace-77114664f666","src":"community","title":"G.O.D WORKOUT PLAN","author":"DeeJay","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/Mw9RhB-untitled-program","desc":"The G.O.D. Workout plan is a structured 12 week training program designed for intermediate lifters seeking to build muscle, increase strength, support, fat loss, and improve overall body composition.\n\nThe program consist of five focused training sessions per week, it’s lasting approximately 70 minutes designed for a fully equipped gym, every workout combines compound movements and isolation exercises to target, all major muscle groups, promote balanced, muscular development, and maximize training efficiency.\n\nProgress throughout the program is driven by progressive overload. Begin each exercise with a weight that allows you to complete the prescribed sets and repetition with proper form and control. Once you can complete every set within the assigned rep range gradually increase the resistance. If you could not complete the required repetition with proper form after increasing the weight remain at the resistance until you can perform every successfully before progressing again.\n\nStay consistent, track your performance, and approach every workout with determination. Every set, repetition, and increase in resistance, will bring you closer to becoming stronger, leaner, and more confident.\n\nGrind. Overcome. Dominate￼","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Women's","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-19T17:01:32.867Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["POWER PUSH","POWER PULL","LOWER-BODY STRENNGHT","UPPER-BODY HYPERTROPHY","LOWER-BODY HYPERTHROPHY"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Smith Machine)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Shoulder Press (Machine)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Cable)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lateral 